-## Physical snapshot authentication
-
-Physical snapshots use a dedicated `mreader_backup` `LOGIN REPLICATION` PostgreSQL role. `hybrid-up.sh` repairs/creates the role, maintains an explicit SCRAM replication HBA rule, reloads PostgreSQL, and probes the physical replication protocol using `IDENTIFY_SYSTEM` before backup self-test succeeds.
-
