-```bash
-./db-backup.sh repair-replication
-./db-backup.sh snapshot
-```
-
-## CLI commands
+## Operator entry points
 
 ```bash
 ./db-backup.sh status
+./db-backup.sh list
+./db-backup.sh check-storage
 ./db-backup.sh manual
-./db-backup.sh daily
