+## Recovery catalog and restore
 
-## Configuration
+The Admin Database Protection page displays opaque recovery IDs and browser-safe metadata from the agent's verified local catalog projection. The agent re-resolves the selected artifact before recovery. Internal host directories, filenames and credentials stay out of public responses.
 
-Application/backup-agent `.env`:
-
-```env
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_ENABLED=true
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_REPLICATION_USER=mreader_backup
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_REPLICATION_PASSWORD=
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_NAS_PATH=backups/mreader/postgres
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_EXPECTED_PHYSICAL_ROOT=/srv/seaweed/hdd/volumes
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_DAILY_RETENTION_DAYS=7
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_SNAPSHOT_EVERY_DAYS=2
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_SNAPSHOT_RETENTION_DAYS=14
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_SNAPSHOT_MAX_RATE=32M
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_PREUPGRADE_RETENTION=5
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_VERIFY_DOWNLOAD=true
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_VERIFY_TIME=21:00
