-NAS `ops/nas-seaweedfs/.env`:
-
-```env
-NAS_SSD_ROOT=/srv/mreader-seaweed/ssd
-NAS_HDD_ROOT=/srv/mreader-seaweed/hdd
-POSTGRES_BACKUP_NAS_PATH=backups/mreader/postgres
