+**Spec:** [Ownership and UI-state consolidation](../specs/2026-09-11-mreader-rc485-ownership-consolidation-design.md).
+
+**Updated:** 2026-09-15. **Source checkpoint reviewed:** `17c28ac65f27314af65cc555dcefc6d62c82913b` (`17c28ac`).
+
+**Current task:** **P06.3 — extend durable Media evidence and implement the Catalog transaction/receipt boundary.** P06.2 is source-complete: commits `7bc7a7f` and `17c28ac65f27314af65cc555dcefc6d62c82913b` define and verify the contract, but no publication writer has been switched.
+
+**Next package:** Milestone 2 after P06/P07 remove the competing publication/cancellation result paths and the relevant available checks pass. A test package must still list every blocked runtime gate. The existing milestone 1 package remains the latest delivered application checkpoint.
